Independent experimental port of XMonad's pure StackSet core to River's native
Wayland window-management protocol. River 0.4 or newer supplies the compositor;
this package supplies policy, layouts, workspaces and keyboard bindings.

This local port recipe has not been built on FreeBSD. It has no published
distfile URL; generate distinfo from the supplied archive with make makesum.
River classic and River 0.3 are incompatible. Arbitrary X11 xmonad.hs files and
XMonad.Contrib modules are not supported.
